                "test_verbose_skip_reason.py::test_long_skip SKIPPED"
                " (1 cannot do foobar",
                "because baz is missing due to I don't know what) *",
                "test_verbose_skip_reason.py::test_long_xfail XFAIL"
                " (2 cannot do foobar",
